  "description": "A free, embedded, serverless object and document database for .NET 10 and .NET Standard 2.0. Stores typed POCOs in a single file or stream, with ACID transactions, secondary indexes, LINQ-style queries, synchronous and asynchronous APIs, thread-safe concurrent reads and optional AES encryption.",
